        classification: "Ophthalmology",
        specialization: "Glaucoma Specialist",
        definition: "An ophthalmologist who specializes in the treatment of glaucoma and other disorders related to increased intraocular pressure and optic nerve damage.  This specialty involves the medical and surgical treatment of these conditions.",
