        classification: "Ophthalmology",
        specialization: "Retina Specialist",
        definition: "An ophthalmologist who specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of vitreoretinal diseases.",
        notes: "Source: American Society of Retina Specialists, www.asrs.org [1/1/2017: new]<br/>Additional Resources: American Academy of Ophthalmology, www.aao.org.  Macula Society, www.maculasociety.org.  Retina Society, www.retinasociety.org.  Association of University Professors of Ophthalmology, www.aupo.org.",
