        notes: "Source: American Board of Medical Specialties, 2007.  www.abms.org [7/1/2007: definition changed, source added]    Additional Resources: American Board of Plastic Surgery, 2007.  http://www.abplsurg.org/.    Board certification for Medical Doctors (MDs) is provided by the American Board of Plastic Surgery.    A subspecialty certificate was approved by the ABMS in 2000.    ACGME Accredited Residency Program Requirements:  None.",
